<ComparePage lang="en" competitor="Wati" competitorSlug="wati" title="Shadia AI vs Wati — AI-native WhatsApp vs messaging platform | Shadia AI" description="Compare Shadia AI vs Wati. Real AI agents, native appointments engine and omnichannel vs a WhatsApp platform with basic automations." canonical="https://shadia.ai/en/compare/vs-wati" ogImage="/og/compare-wati-en.png" heroHeadline="Shadia AI vs Wati — Real AI vs automated messaging" heroSubheadline="Wati helps you send messages on WhatsApp. Shadia AI runs your entire business on WhatsApp and beyond — with agents that think, not just send." verdictPoints={['Real conversational AI (LLM) vs basic flow automations','Native appointments engine: no additional tools needed','Omnichannel: WhatsApp + Instagram + TikTok + Facebook vs WhatsApp only','Shadia Agent — the AI on your team','Competitive pricing with more value included']} compareRows={compareRows} detailedText={`<h2>What does Wati do well?</h2><p>Wati is a good option for companies that need to send bulk messages via WhatsApp Business API, set up basic auto-replies and manage a support team on WhatsApp. It's a mature platform with good reliability.</p><h2>The fundamental difference</h2><p>Wati runs on automation logic: if the client types A, respond B. Shadia uses LLMs to understand client intent, maintain context throughout the conversation and make decisions autonomously — like a real human agent, but available 24/7.</p><p>Additionally, Wati is primarily a WhatsApp platform. Shadia unifies WhatsApp, Instagram, TikTok and Facebook in one platform, with the same AI managing all channels.</p>`} migrationText="If you currently use Wati, migrating to Shadia takes less than 48 hours. We import your contacts, templates and team configurations." faqs={faqs} />
